  <div class="section-head">
    <h2>Specifications</h2>
    <div class="section-eyebrow" id="specEyebrow">CRC Gehry · 4&Prime; + 6&Prime; Universal Recessed Housing · E26 Legacy or T24 / JA8 LED-Only · die-formed aluminum can · TP24 Quick Connect J-Box · IC + AIR-TIGHT</div>
  </div>

  <table class="spec-table">
    <tbody>
      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Construction</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Can Body</td><td class="spec-val">Die-formed all-aluminum can (per CRC6-Gehry-Datasheet.pdf page 1) &middot; cylindrical above-ceiling profile &middot; radiates passively into the joist cavity. <em>Honesty marker: older 2023 QuickSheet says &ldquo;steel construction&rdquo; &mdash; flagged for engineering reconciliation.</em></td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Bracket</td><td class="spec-val">Pre-installed Swivel Bracket (-SB suffix · only bracket type currently shipping · future-proofed for additional bracket designs) &middot; <strong>90&deg; pivoting plate</strong> lets the can rotate flush against either joist for skinny-cavity installs &middot; bracket footprint scales with can size: 8 1/8&Prime; W &times; 11 7/8&Prime; L (CRC4) or 11 7/8&Prime; W &times; 14 7/8&Prime; L (CRC6)</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Bar Hangers</td><td class="spec-val">Pre-installed adjustable bar hangers &middot; 24&Prime; on-center joist span default &middot; <strong>field-shortenable to 12&Prime; OC</strong> for legacy framing or remodel cavities &middot; 4&times; double-headed nail holes through bracket plate for joist-crown attachment</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Finish</td><td class="spec-val">Default: unbadged die-formed aluminum &middot; Optional: <code>/WH</code> white-painted accessory variant (display-only suffix · appended to SKU as <code>/WH</code> · not part of housing&rsquo;s required spec)</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">J-Box</td><td class="spec-val">Remote Plug-n-Play J-Box ships with the housing &middot; <strong>TP24 Quick Connect coupler pre-installed</strong> in the J-Box (4-conductor industry-standard fast-disconnect for tool-free service swaps) &middot; 4&times; Romex knockouts for branch-circuit termination &middot; mounts above the ceiling on a joist or T-grid drop</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Ingress / Location</td><td class="spec-val">Indoor recessed ceiling install &middot; Damp Location listed &middot; <strong>AIR-TIGHT &middot; AIR-SHUT</strong> certified per ASTM E283 (&lt; 2.0 CFM at 75 Pa) &middot; satisfies IECC &sect;&nbsp;R402.4.5 envelope-leakage limit for recessed lighting in the building thermal envelope</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Operating Temp</td><td class="spec-val">&minus;22&deg;F to +105&deg;F (&minus;30&deg;C to +41&deg;C) ambient &middot; standard recessed-can range</td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Light Source · See Companion Module / Lamp</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Built-In Light Source</td><td class="spec-val"><strong>None</strong> &mdash; the Gehry housing is infrastructure. The photometric output is determined by the lamp or LED retrofit module the installer drops into the socket. Wattage, lumens, lm/W, CCT, CRI, and beam distribution all flow from the chosen lamp/module &mdash; not the housing itself.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Photometric Reference Baseline</td><td class="spec-val">Datasheet ships a <strong>75W PAR30 incandescent</strong> reference: 3 ft throw = 222 fc / 26 ft beam spread &middot; 6 ft throw = 56 fc / 52 ft beam spread &middot; 9 ft throw = 25 fc / 79 ft beam spread (60&deg; PAR30 reference beam). <em>Honesty marker: the 75W PAR30 incandescent baseline is a 30+ year-old reference lamp. A modern 12W LED PAR30 retrofit delivers approximately 16% of these footcandles on a wattage-matched basis &mdash; but with ~6&times; the lumens-per-watt efficacy.</em></td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Base Type</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">/E26 Legacy Lamp Socket</td><td class="spec-val">E26 medium-base universal lamp socket &middot; accepts every standard medium-base lamp shape: <strong>PAR30 (up to 75W incandescent / halogen / 12W LED), PAR38 (CRC6 only · up to 75W), R30 (75W), BR30 (65W), BR40 (CRC6 only), A19 (60W)</strong>, plus the multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY RL Series LED Retrofit Module family. Universal install path everywhere outside California.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">/T24 JA8 LED-Only</td><td class="spec-val">California Title 20 + Title 24 / JA8-2022-E compliant socket &middot; <strong>locks out incandescent and unqualified CFL replacement lamps</strong> &middot; satisfies the high-efficacy luminaire (HEL) requirement for new-construction recessed cans in CA residential and small-commercial spaces &middot; accepts JA8-qualified LED PAR30 / PAR38 lamps and the multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY RL Series LED Retrofit Module</td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Companion · multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY LED Retrofit Module (separate SKU)</td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="NEBULA-II"><td class="spec-attr">Nebula-II (LDRR) ★ <strong style="color:var(--brand-red); font-size: 7.5pt; letter-spacing: 0.6pt;">RECOMMENDED PAIR</strong></td><td class="spec-val">ECO recessed retrofit module &middot; <strong>2 sizes (LDRR410 4&Prime; / LDRR615 6&Prime;)</strong> &middot; 10W / 15W &middot; 880 / 1,320 lm &middot; 88 lm/W &middot; 5-CCTselect (27/30/35/40/50K) &middot; CRI 90+ &middot; 100&deg; flood &middot; DLC Premium &middot; the canonical multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY companion designed alongside Gehry &mdash; LDRR410 drops into CRC4, LDRR615 drops into CRC6, both via the TP24 J-Box for tool-free service swaps &middot; 5-yr ECO warranty</td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="ECRESCENT"><td class="spec-attr">eCrescent (LSMT)</td><td class="spec-val">ECO edge-lit LED retrofit module &middot; 2 sizes (LSMT410 4&Prime; / LSMT615 6&Prime;) &middot; 10W / 15W &middot; 750 / 1,100 lm &middot; <strong>built-in PIR sensor with 3-position dip switch</strong> &middot; 5-CCTselect &middot; drops into TP24-equipped Gehry J-Box &middot; 5-yr ECO warranty</td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="RADIUS-II"><td class="spec-attr">Radius-II (LDRS)</td><td class="spec-val">PRO slim wafer LED retrofit &middot; 3 sizes (LDRS4 4&Prime; / LDRS6 6&Prime; / LDRS8 8&Prime;) &middot; 9W / 12W / 18W &middot; 644 / 1,041 / 1,504 lm &middot; 5-CCTselect dip switch on the J-Box &middot; CRI 90+ &middot; PRO 7-yr warranty &middot; Wet Location · ETL-listed &middot; DLC Premium</td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="ECLIPSE-II"><td class="spec-attr">Eclipse-II (LDLL)</td><td class="spec-val">PRO surface puck &middot; 5 sizes (LDLL0510 / 0715 / 0918 / 1121 / 1324 &middot; 5/7/9/11/13&Prime;) &middot; driverless edge-lit PMMA &middot; 103 lm/W peak &middot; 5-CCTselect &middot; sensor-ready (1-Pin Plug-n-Play Bi-Level port) &middot; DLC Premium &middot; <em>4&Prime; size N/A &mdash; CRC4 snaps to LDLL0510 (5&Prime; closest fit), CRC6 snaps to LDLL0715 (7&Prime; closest fit)</em></td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="LUNAR-ECLIPSE"><td class="spec-attr">Lunar Eclipse (LDLL)</td><td class="spec-val">PRO trimless surface puck &middot; black-only sister to Eclipse-II &middot; 3 sizes (LDLL0510 / 0715 / 0918 · 5/7/9&Prime;) &middot; <strong>IP65 wet-rated</strong> upgrade over Eclipse-II IP44 &middot; 5-CCTselect &middot; sensor-ready &middot; <em>same closest-fit mapping: CRC4 → LDLL0510, CRC6 → LDLL0715</em></td></tr>
      <tr data-mod-row="ORBIT-I"><td class="spec-attr">Orbit-I (LDGR)</td><td class="spec-val">PRO retrofit gimbal trim &middot; 2 sizes (LDGR410 4&Prime; / LDGR615 6&Prime;) &middot; 10W / 15W &middot; <strong>60&deg; tilt + 360&deg; rotation</strong> &middot; for accent / wall-wash / directional aiming &middot; PRO 7-yr warranty</td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Compatible Lamp · A19 (separate SKU · for E26 socket path)</td></tr>
      <tr data-lamp-row="A19"><td class="spec-attr">A19 LED · LTA19F800xxMB</td><td class="spec-val">multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY A19 LED lamp &middot; <strong>800 lm &middot; 8.5W &middot; 94 lm/W</strong> &middot; medium-base E26 omnidirectional &middot; <strong>5 active SKUs</strong>: LTA19F80027MB · LTA19F80030MB · LTA19F80035MB · LTA19F80040MB · LTA19F80050MB (xx = first 2 chars of CCT &middot; 2700/3000/3500/4000/5000K) &middot; CRC4 + CRC6 &middot; <strong>E26 base only</strong> (not JA8-qualified for T24 install path) &middot; for closet / pantry / service-room / corridor ambient applications</td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Mounting</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Standard Install</td><td class="spec-val">Joist-mounted swivel bracket &middot; pre-installed adjustable bar hangers (24&Prime; OC default) &middot; field-shortenable to 12&Prime; OC for legacy framing &middot; 4&times; double-headed nails into joist crown &middot; TP24 Quick Connect cable from can to remote J-Box &middot; J-Box mounts above ceiling on adjacent joist</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Ceiling Thickness Adjustment</td><td class="spec-val">1/2&Prime; &ndash; 1-3/8&Prime; (adjustable) &middot; identical across both sizes &middot; accommodates standard 1/2&Prime; drywall up to 1-3/8&Prime; double-layer fire-rated assemblies</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">IC Rating</td><td class="spec-val">IC (Insulation Contact) rated &middot; the housing can be buried directly in attic blown-in or batt insulation with no clearance keep-out &middot; no re-blowing the insulation around a fire-rated can</td></tr>

      <tr class="spec-section-head"><td colspan="2">Compliance &amp; Certifications</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Standards (Both SKUs)</td><td class="spec-val">UL listed (US) &middot; cULus (US + Canada) &middot; ETL listed &middot; IC Rated &middot; AIR-TIGHT &middot; AIR-SHUT (ASTM E283 &lt; 2.0 CFM @ 75 Pa) &middot; Damp Location</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">T24 SKU Adds</td><td class="spec-val">CA Title 20 + Title 24 Part 6 (compliant for new-construction CA residential + small-commercial recessed cans) &middot; JA8-2022-E qualified socket (locks out incandescent + non-JA8 CFL replacement lamps)</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Rebate-Ready (via Module)</td><td class="spec-val"><strong>Honesty marker:</strong> the Gehry housing itself is infrastructure &mdash; rebates flow through the LED retrofit module that drops INTO the housing. Spec the housing with a <code>/T24</code> base + a JA8-qualified module from the multi-f<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>MILY family (eCrescent ECO · Radius-II PRO · Eclipse-II PRO/DLC · Lunar Eclipse PRO) and the project unlocks <strong>CalEnergyWise, PG&amp;E / SCE / SDG&amp;E utility rebates, HUD multi-family programs</strong>, and (for DLC-listed pairings) <strong>commercial rebate ladders</strong>. Search "LSMT / LDRS" at archipelagolighting.com/support/rebate-center/.</td></tr>
      <tr><td class="spec-attr">Warranty</td><td class="spec-val">5-year limited housing warranty (can &middot; bracket &middot; bar hangers &middot; J-Box &middot; TP24 coupler) &middot; LED retrofit module warranty is separate (per-module &mdash; eCrescent 5-yr ECO &middot; Radius-II 7-yr PRO &middot; Eclipse-II / Lunar Eclipse 5-yr PRO) &middot; all 4 base SKUs + 4 finish-variant SKUs ship QuickShip</td></tr>
